1	/**
2	 * Gravity Forms Authentication Module
3	 * Supports Basic Authentication (primary) and OAuth 1.0a (secondary)
4	 *
5	 * Basic Authentication is prioritized per Gravity Forms v2 recommendations
6	 * OAuth 1.0a included for advanced security requirements
7	 */
